{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261027%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E6%B6%89%E8%A5%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%AB%98%E7%90%83%E5%A0%B4%E5%85%A9%E5%BA%A6%E9%9D%9E%E7%A6%AE%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90-23%E6%AD%B2%E7%94%B7%E6%95%99%E5%AE%98%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7-%E5%87%865000%E5%85%83%E4%BF%9D%E9%87%8B-%E6%8A%BC%E5%BE%8C%E8%87%B312.9%E5%86%8D%E8%A8%8A-977x1024.jpg\" width=\"977\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>一名報稱教官的23歲男子，涉去年在西沙GO PARK高爾夫球場兩度非禮一名女子，被控兩罪，案件今（27日）在沙田裁判法院首度提堂。被告暫毋須答辯，案件押後至12月9日再訊，被告准以5,000元保釋外出。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告劉宇俊（23歲，報稱教官）被控兩項非禮罪，涉於2025年6月8日，在新界馬鞍山海映路9號西沙GO PARK AGA西沙高爾夫球場，兩度猥褻侵犯女子X</p>\n<p>法院：沙田裁判法院<br/>被告：劉宇俊<br/>控罪：非禮<br/>案件編號：STCC3886/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:42:43.741776+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:16:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T02:38:55.719317+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:18.240351+00:00","content_hash":"defe5742e64caa618720f7994a257882b84a39b3629efb3c76dc678dc6ed2c3a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"conten